OL,3,AAt least seven killed and more than 100
OL,4,Ainjured in Egypt train collision,
OL,5,Ahealth ministry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least seven people have died and
OL,8,Fdozens are injured after a train
OL,9,Fcollision in al-Ayyat in Egypt's Giza
OL,10,Fgovernorate, the local health ministry
OL,11,Fsays
OL,13,FA train driver is among those killed,
OL,14,Fthe ministry adds - it's not yet clear
OL,15,Fwhat caused the collision
OL,17,FMore than 70 ambulances have been
OL,18,Fdeployed to the scene, officials say,
OL,19,Fwith at least 112 people thought to
OL,20,Fhave sustained injuries
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
