OL,3,AAt least seven killed and more than 100
OL,4,Ainjured in Egypt train collision,
OL,5,Ahealth ministry says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree hospitals are being used to treat
OL,8,Fthe wounded, the health ministry says
OL,9,Fin its statement
OL,11,FImages show derailed train carriages
OL,12,Fwith large crowds of people nearby, and
OL,13,FEgyptian Red Crescent workers at the
OL,14,Fscene
